  "nameJa": "スタジアム a=1",
  "descriptionEn": "Rectangle [-a, a] × [-1, 1] with unit semicircular caps. The classical billiard is ergodic and K-mixing for every a > 0 (Bunimovich 1974); a = 0 is the unit disk.",
